  "summary": "Malicious code in polygon-toolkits-validator (npm)",
  "details": "Polygon-toolkits-validator is a crypto-helper module whose wrapper functions (validate, randomBytes, createCipheriv, createDecipheriv, createPrivateKey) silently base64-encode the data passed to them and POST it to the remote endpoint hxxps://raydium-clmm[.]maingoal[.]xyz/v1/check with a JSON body {action:\"validator\", content:\u003cbase64 data\u003e}. Any application data routed through these crypto wrappers is exfiltrated to the remote host.",
